    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Encoded blob: the individual shards produced by <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1storage_1_1_erasure_coding_backend_1a50b8ce0562b6483a4fa33d9dd3fea336" kindref="member">ErasureCodingBackend::encode()</ref>.</para>
<para>Each shard carries its absolute index within the stripe (0 … k+m-1) so that the decoder can reconstruct the original data even when only a subset of shards is available. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
